Anyhow: PYEC belongs to a class of 'intelligent' items, and will blast you
if it doesn't like you... And it won't like you, unless you are a neutral
tourist. And if you are a neutral tourist - you can't wish for it, because
you'll screw up your quest. In short - don't wish for it early in the game
- you may not survive it. There are so many other nice items to wish for...
(I personally consider wishing for quest items to be nethack abuse and don't
